  "level": "상",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$일 때,\n$\\{(1+3t)^3+(1-3t)^3\\}^2-\\{(1+3t)^3-(1-3t)^3\\}^2$\n의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "-32",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\{(1+3t)^3+(1-3t)^3\\}^2-\\{(1+3t)^3-(1-3t)^3\\}^2$\n에서 $1+3t=a$, $1-3t=b$로 놓으면\n$\\{(1+3t)^3+(1-3t)^3\\}^2-\\{(1+3t)^3-(1-3t)^3\\}^2$\n$$=(a^3+b^3)^2-(a^3-b^3)^2$$\n$$=a^6+2a^3b^3+b^6-(a^6-2a^3b^3+b^6)=4a^3b^3$$\n$$=4(1+3t)^3(1-3t)^3$$\n$$=4(1-9t^2)^3$$\n$$=4\\left(1-9\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^3$$\n$$4\\cdot(-2)^3=-32$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "FAN-공수1-G1-P09",
  "source": "학원교재",
